THIRD-PARTY AND REFERENCE MATERIAL

This project's runtime dependencies (React, react-dom, Recharts, Vite and
@vitejs/plugin-react) are each distributed under the MIT License by their
respective authors. They are not vendored into this repository; they are
resolved from npm at build time.

The weight, performance and acoustic METHODS implemented here are drawn from
published literature, principally the NDARC Theory Manual and the AFDD
weight equations (NASA), NASA/TM-20210017971, EASA SC-VTOL and its Means of
Compliance, IEC 61672-1 and ISO 9613-1. Those documents are the property of
their publishers and are NOT redistributed here. What this repository
contains is an independent implementation of the published methods, together
with the numeric results of running it, each traced to its source in the
code and in VALIDATION.md.

